// Opt into guarded mode: copy to <project>/.semctx/guard.json
// The PreToolUse guard will then block `git commit` / `git push` until the current working diff
// has been verified with `semctx verify diff --record` (or the plugin-bundled CLI, whose absolute
// path the guard prints when it blocks) and the recorded verdict is not BLOCK.
// Optional: "hooks": "project-managed" keeps a Lefthook/husky hook chain and moves the content
// proof to its last job, `semctx verify hook pre-commit` / `pre-push` (ADR 0029).
// Strictly disable at any time with the environment variable SEMCTX_GUARD=off.
{
  "enabled": true
}
